#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:3646
msgid "Turn the speaker off and on again, then reconnect it."
msgstr "Lülita kõlar korraks välja ja uuesti sisse, siis ühenda uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:4061
msgid "Station seems to be off the air"
