#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:906
msgid "The Bluetooth speaker trails by %1 ms, and every speaker's loudness was matched at the microphone — all set and remembered."
msgstr "Bluetooth-kõlar jääb maha %1 ms ja kõlarite valjus ühtlustati mikrofoni järgi — kõik on seatud ja jäetud meelde."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:907
msgid "The Bluetooth speaker trails by %1 ms — the delay is set and remembered for this device."
msgstr "Bluetooth-kõlar jääb %1 ms maha — viide on seatud ja jääb sellele seadmele meelde."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:909
msgid "Balance levels set earlier were replaced by the measured ones."
msgstr "Varem seatud balansitasemed asendati mõõdetud tasemetega."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:915
msgid "The speakers were matched to the quietest one and the group's volume was raised by %1% to make up for it."
msgstr "Kõlarid viidi kõige vaiksemaga ühele tasemele ja rühma helitugevust tõsteti selle võrra %1% tagasi."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:916
msgid "The speakers were matched to the quietest one, so the room is quieter than before — turn the volume up if you want it back."
msgstr "Kõlarid viidi kõige vaiksemaga ühele tasemele, nii et tuba on varasemast vaiksem — keera helitugevust juurde, kui tahad selle tagasi."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:925
msgid "The microphone clipped on %1 — that balance was left unchanged; lower the speaker's volume and calibrate again."
msgstr "Mikrofon läks %1 peal ülevõimendusse — see balanss jäi muutmata; keera kõlari heli vaiksemaks ja kalibreeri uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:938
msgid "Measured with %1 — the default microphone stayed silent."
msgstr "Mõõdetud mikrofoniga %1 — vaikimisi mikrofon jäi vait."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:939
msgid "Speakers calibrated"
msgstr "Kõlarid kalibreeritud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:952
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:960
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1021
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1029
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1033
msgid "Calibration did not succeed"
msgstr "Kalibratsioon ei õnnestunud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:953
msgid "The inaudible tone did not reach the microphone from these speakers. Move the microphone closer, or turn off \"Measure with a tone too high to hear\" to measure with the audible clicks."
msgstr "Kuuldamatu toon ei jõudnud nendest kõlaritest mikrofonini. Too mikrofon lähemale või lülita „Mõõda tooniga, mida ei kuule“ välja, et mõõta kuuldavate klõpsudega."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:961
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1393
msgid "Every microphone delivered pure silence. A mic's own mute button is invisible to the system — check the light on the microphone itself, or set a working microphone as the default."
msgstr "Iga mikrofon andis puhast vaikust. Mikrofoni enda vaigistusnupp on süsteemile nähtamatu — kontrolli tulukest mikrofoni peal või sea vaikimisi mikrofoniks töötav mikrofon."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:993
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "Kalibratsioon"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:995
msgid "The inaudible reading would not settle at this level — trying once more, louder."
msgstr "Kuuldamatu lugem ei settinud sellel tasemel paika — proovime veel korra, valjemini."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:996
msgid "The clicks were too quiet for this room — trying once more, louder."
msgstr "Klikid jäid selle toa jaoks liiga vaikseks — proovin veel korra, valjemini."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1022
msgid "The two speakers timed impossibly far apart, so nothing was changed. A speaker that has just reconnected usually needs a minute to settle — try again shortly."
msgstr "Kaks kõlarit mõõdeti võimatult kaugele teineteisest, seega ei muudetud midagi. Äsja taasühendunud kõlar vajab tavaliselt minuti settimiseks — proovi natukese aja pärast uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1030
msgid "The reading would not settle even with the speakers turned up — nothing was changed. Trying again usually does it."
msgstr "Lugem ei settinud ka valjemaks keeratud kõlaritega — midagi ei muudetud. Tavaliselt aitab uus katse."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1034
msgid "Make sure the microphone is not covered and both speakers can be heard, then try again."
msgstr "Veendu, et mikrofon pole kaetud ja mõlemat kõlarit on kuulda, siis proovi uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1068
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1116
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1151
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1304
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1337
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1360
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1366
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1392
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1407
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1453
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1458
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1465
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1478
msgid "Sync check"
msgstr "Sünki kontroll"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1069
msgid "%1 is muted, so the check skipped it. Unmute it and check again to include it."
msgstr "%1 on vaigistatud, seega jättis kontroll ta vahele. Võta vaigistus maha ja kontrolli uuesti, et ta kaasa võtta."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1117
msgid "The speakers were %1 ms apart — measuring once more to confirm."
msgstr "Kõlarid olid %1 ms lahus — mõõdame kinnituseks veel korra."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1152
msgid "Two measurements disagreed about the room, so nothing was changed. If the speakers sound apart, press Calibrate."
msgstr "Kaks mõõtmist ei langenud toa osas kokku, seega ei muudetud midagi. Kui kõlarid kõlavad lahus, vajuta Kalibreeri."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1305
msgid "The room still reads %1 ms apart, but the difference sits on the wired speaker's road, which does not drift by itself — nothing was changed. If the speakers sound apart, press Calibrate."
msgstr "Tuba näitab endiselt %1 ms vahet, aga erinevus istub juhtmega kõlari teel, mis iseenesest ei triivi — midagi ei muudetud. Kui kõlarid kõlavad lahus, vajuta Kalibreeri."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1309
msgid "The speakers were %1 ms apart — adjusted from the measurement, checking once more."
msgstr "Kõlarid olid %1 ms vahega — korrigeerisin mõõtmise järgi, kontrollin veel korra."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1327
msgid "A speaker's route was stuck %1 ms behind — flushed it, checking once more."
msgstr "Ühe kõlari tee oli %1 ms kinni kiilunud — loputasin selle, kontrollin veel korra."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1361
msgid "The check compares speakers, and too many are muted to compare. Unmute them and check again."
msgstr "Kontroll võrdleb kõlareid, aga võrdlemiseks on liiga paljud vaigistatud. Võta vaigistus maha ja kontrolli uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1367
msgid "This speaker does not carry the inaudible test tone, so the check needed the audible one — and the room was too noisy for it. Pause other audio and try again."
msgstr "See kõlar ei kanna kuulmatut testtooni, nii et kontroll vajas kuuldavat — ja tuba oli selle jaoks liiga lärmakas. Peata muu heli ja proovi uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1385
msgid "Sync check skipped"
msgstr "Sünkroonikontroll jäeti vahele"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1386
msgid "The speakers here do not carry the inaudible tone to the microphone. Move the microphone closer, or turn off \"Measure with a tone too high to hear\" to use the audible clicks."
msgstr "Siinsed kõlarid ei kanna kuuldamatut tooni mikrofonini. Too mikrofon lähemale või lülita „Mõõda tooniga, mida ei kuule“ välja, et kasutada kuuldavaid klõpse."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1388
msgid "Auto-check: cannot measure without a sound you would hear"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll: ilma kuuldava helita ei saa mõõta"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1408
msgid "The reading from %1 would not settle, so nothing was changed. Trying again usually does it."
msgstr "%1 lugem ei settinud paika, seega ei muudetud midagi. Tavaliselt aitab uus katse."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1454
msgid "%1 stayed silent through both rounds — it was left out of the group. Tick it back in the speaker list any time."
msgstr "%1 püsis mõlemas voorus vait — see jäeti grupist välja. Linnukesega kõlarite nimekirjas saad ta igal hetkel tagasi."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1459
msgid "%1 made no sound the microphone could hear. If it stays silent on the next calibration too, it will be left out of the group."
msgstr "%1 ei teinud ühtegi heli, mida mikrofon kuuleks. Kui ta jääb vait ka järgmisel kalibreerimisel, jäetakse ta grupist välja."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1466
msgid "Could not hear %1 during the check — the speaker may be muted or off. The calibration was kept."
msgstr "Kontrolli ajal ei olnud %1 kuulda — kõlar võib olla vaigistatud või väljas. Kalibratsioon jäi alles."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1474
msgid "Sync verified"
msgstr "Sünk kinnitatud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1475
msgid "Every speaker arrives within %1 ms at the microphone — in step to the ear."
msgstr "Iga kõlar jõuab mikrofonini %1 ms sees — kõrva jaoks ühes taktis."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1479
msgid "The speakers still arrive %1 ms apart. Calibrate once more, or nudge the delay slider."
msgstr "Kõlarid saabuvad endiselt %1 ms vahega. Kalibreeri veel kord või nihuta viite liugurit."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1521
msgid "Auto-check %1: skipped, something else was using the speakers"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: jäi vahele, kõlarid olid millegi muu all"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1547
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1621
msgid "Auto-check %1: settling after the adjustment"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: settib pärast muudatust"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1574
msgid "Auto-check %1: reading would not settle — the microphone may be too far from the speakers"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: näit ei jäänud paigale — mikrofon võib olla kõlaritest liiga kaugel"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1579
msgid "Auto-check %1: too quiet to tell"
msgstr "Autokontroll %1: liiga vaikne, et öelda"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1729
msgid "Auto-check %1: in sync — measured %2 ms"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: sünkis — mõõdetud %2 ms"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1730
msgid "Auto-check %1: in sync"
msgstr "Autokontroll %1: sünkis"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1740
msgid "Auto-check %1: %2 ms apart — measured %3 ms"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: %2 ms lahus — mõõdetud %3 ms"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1741
msgid "Auto-check %1: still %2 ms apart (0 = in step)"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: endiselt %2 ms vahet (0 = ühes sammus)"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1778
msgid "Sync has drifted"
msgstr "Sünk on triivinud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1779
msgid "The speakers are audibly apart again — run Calibrate when convenient."
msgstr "Kõlarid on taas kuuldavalt lahus — käivita kalibratsioon, kui mahti on."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1888
msgid "Speaker timing drifted"
msgstr "Kõlari ajastus on triivinud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:1889
msgid "A Bluetooth speaker came back noticeably off its calibration — the sync compensated automatically. Recalibrate when convenient for exact ears."
msgstr "Bluetooth-kõlar tuli tagasi märgatavalt oma kalibratsioonist väljas — sünk kompenseeris automaatselt. Kalibreeri uuesti, kui mahti on, et kõrv oleks täpne."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:2494
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:2598
msgid "Auto-check: listening…"
msgstr "Autokontroll: kuulan…"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:2569
msgid "Auto-check %1: only one speaker can hear the inaudible tone — nothing to compare"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: kuuldamatut tooni kuuleb ainult üks kõlar — pole millega võrrelda"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:2628
msgid "Auto-check %1: no answer came back"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll %1: vastust ei tulnud"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:2676
msgid "%1: %2 ms"
msgstr "%1: %2 ms"

#. i18n() is given at runtime and the translation is
#. silently skipped in every language.
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3235
msgid "Sync measurement"
msgstr "Sünkroonimise mõõtmine"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3236
msgid "A recording is running. The measurement plays test tones and quiets the speakers, so it waits until the recording is done."
msgstr "Käib salvestus. Mõõtmine mängib testtoone ja vaigistab kõlarid, seega ootab see salvestuse lõppu."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3413
msgid "Measuring with a tone too high to hear — about two minutes in total. The music stays silent until the check finishes."
msgstr "Mõõdan tooniga, mis on kuulmisest kõrgem — kokku umbes kaks minutit. Muusika püsib vait, kuni kontroll lõpeb."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3414
msgid "Two rounds of clicks with a quiet check between them — about two minutes in total. The music stays silent until the check finishes."
msgstr "Kaks klõpsuvooru, nende vahel vaikne kontroll — kokku umbes kaks minutit. Muusika püsib vait, kuni kontroll lõpeb."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3416
msgid "Skipped (empty jack): %1."
msgstr "Vahele jäetud (tühi pesa): %1."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3417
msgid "Calibration started"
msgstr "Kalibratsioon algas"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:3484
msgid "All local outputs (On Air)"
msgstr "Kõik kohalikud väljundid (On Air)"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4357
msgid "Auto-check: measured %1 ms — takes effect the next time the music pauses"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll: mõõdetud %1 ms — jõustub, kui muusika järgmine kord peatub"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4358
msgid "Auto-check: adjusted — takes effect the next time the music pauses"
msgstr "Automaatkontroll: paika seatud — jõustub, kui muusika järgmine kord peatub"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4472
msgid "Auto-check %1: confirming the room after the rebuild…"
msgstr "Autokontroll %1: kinnitan ruumi pärast ümberehitust…"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4513
msgid "Auto-check %1: in step after the rebuild"
msgstr "Autokontroll %1: pärast ümberehitust sünkis"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4547
#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:4585
msgid "Auto-check %1: adjusted — takes effect the next time the music pauses"
msgstr "Autokontroll %1: paika seatud — jõustub, kui muusika järgmine kord peatub"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:5159
msgid "%1 did not join the sync"
msgstr "%1 ei liitunud sünkrooniga"

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:5161
msgid "The speaker is connected but could not be pulled into the group — switch the sync off and on to rebuild it."
msgstr "Kõlar on ühendatud, aga teda ei õnnestunud gruppi tuua — lülita sünk korraks välja ja uuesti sisse."

#: package/contents/ui/SyncEngine.qml:5162
msgid "The speaker is connected but its audio output never appeared — switch the speaker off and on, then connect it again."
msgstr "Kõlar on ühendatud, aga selle heliväljundit ei tekkinud — lülita kõlar korraks välja ja sisse ning ühenda uuesti."

#: package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml:433
msgid "Not enough free disk space"
msgstr "Kettal pole piisavalt vaba ruumi"

#~ msgid "Search and discovery row"
#~ msgstr "Otsingu- ja avastusriba"

#~ msgid "Listens now and then while music plays, and re-measures with short clicks if the speakers drift apart. The music pauses for about a minute when it does."
